Subject: [PATCH] Wiki: Backend (old) and Artefact tabs from the three 2025
 backend documents

Backend (old) summarises the Deep Dive, the Technical Architecture
Documentation and the Wiki Aurelia: how the 2025 system worked, its
taxonomy, its data shapes rewritten as Zod, the prompts worth reusing and
where each piece goes today. Artefact turns the same documents into eleven
lessons for the new backend. Both are Markdown in docs/backend-old/,
rendered like the PRD. The tab strip now scrolls the open tab into view,
since eight tabs overflow a phone.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
